      "notes.6": "English policy: Standard TOEFL 92/120 or 5/6, IELTS 7, DET 125. Lower in-person ranges (TOEFL 80–91 or 4.5, IELTS 6.5, DET 115–124) need program approval and ESLAT. Scores must be less than two years old at enrollment; no score-only automatic pass is issued."
